    "body": "I would like to keep the visual selection after commenting (out) a block of code.\r\n\r\nAlso I would not like to change lines.\r\n\r\nIs this possible?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I would like to keep the visual selection after commenting (out) a block of code.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also I would not like to change lines.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Is this possible?</p>",
    "bodyText": "I would like to keep the visual selection after commenting (out) a block of code.\nAlso I would not like to change lines.\nIs this possible?",
